parate and not rejected.","count":12,"whole_SUNNY_family_complete":false,"retained_other_profile":"R=(5,0), L=(7,0), O=(0,0); not rejected by this optional-transitive investigation."},"checks":{"candidate_count":12,"generated_addresses_per_candidate":72,"word_targets":144,"common_word_targets":8,"shared_addresses":[[0,0],[6,0],[0,3],[6,3]],"minimum_phase_observations":2},"proofs":[{"id":"OP-UNANIMITY","stage":"extended-conditional","premises":["Source optional transitive family R=(5,b), L=(7,d), b+d=s in{1,5} mod6.","Observed coordinate labels and origin are fixed."],"derivation":["For word R^r L^l, phase q=(r-l)b+ls modulo6, angular p=5r+7l modulo12.","Compare b and b+1 with s fixed: independence of b iff r-l=0 modulo6.","Compare s=1 and s=5: independence iff4l=0 modulo6, equivalently l=0 modulo3.","Both are necessary and sufficient. Thus r=l modulo6 and l=0 modulo3.","For representatives0<=r,l<12, eight words satisfy this criterion, with four shared addresses."],"consequence":"Some localities are determined across all twelve completions without selecting an absolute orientation.","limits":["The source phase-preserving profile is another retained family and is not eliminated.","Shared values are conditional family consequences, not blind historical predictions."],"sourceRefs":["756f07b8874af89bc5f8ba247cb20b67e3d1b7da98eb35819bdd253247da75f2"]},{"id":"OP-MINIMUM-PHASE-PROBES","stage":"extended-conditional","derivation":["Every one-word phase observation has at most6values because q is modulo6; angular displacement is the same in every candidate.","Therefore no single one-word address observation can distinguish12candidates.","The ordered observations q(R)=b and q(O)=s identify(b,s), hence d=s-b modulo6, uniquely.","They attain the lower bound of two such observations. Independent source-to-phase evidence is still needed to instantiate either observation."],"minimal_observations_in_this_class":2,"sourceRefs":["756f07b8874af89bc5f8ba247cb20b67e3d1b7da98eb35819bdd253247da75f2"]},{"id":"OP-FINITE-ADDRESS-EXACT-PITCH","stage":"reproduced-and-derived-conditional","premises":["Exact rational scalar laws R=2/3,L=3/4,O=1/2; octave equivalence is multiplication by integer powers of2."],"derivation":["R^r L^l O^o=2^(r-2l-o)3^(l-r).","Unique prime factorization implies two such products agree modulo octaves iff their3-exponents l-r agree.","The exact scalar R has infinite order modulo octaves: no nonzero integern has3^n equal to a power of2.","The finite address R has order12, yet R^12=4096/531441 and2^7 R^12=524288/531441 !=1.","Thus exact rational pitch cannot descend faithfully through this finite address projection. An additional residual or path quantity must remain; this does not prescribe its geometric realization."],"example":{"scalar":"4096/531441","octave_compensated":"524288/531441","finite_address":[0,0]},"sourceRefs":["756f07b8874af89bc5f8ba247cb20b67e3d1b7da98eb35819bdd253247da75f2"]}],"common_words":[{"r":0,"l":0,"key":"word:0:0"},{"r":0,"l":6,"key":"word:0:6"},{"r":3,"l":3,"key":"word:3:3"},{"r":3,"l":9,"key":"word:3:9"},{"r":6,"l":0,"key":"word:6:0"},{"r":6,"l":6,"key":"word:6:6"},{"r":9,"l":3,"key":"word:9:3"},{"r":9,"l":9,"key":"word:9:9"}],"conditional_predictions":{"schema":"sunny.conditional-prediction-set.v1","scope":"supplied-family-and-declared-premises-only","evaluation":{"schema":"sunny.constraint-evaluation.v1","kernel":{"id":"SUN_GG_v1_final","version":"2026-09-30","sha256":"6a92f9710fa6cd2937b9b07c42315b7d9c80644bd453c659f17318f95c55f95d","sourceRefs":["9e03168cabf04e3887245d93c75f1f9d0034a53bead61e5d8b5a5e0315b259e8"]},"scope":"supplied-candidate-family-only","exhaustiveOverSuppliedCandidates":true,"familyCompleteness":"not-established","canonicalPromotion":false,"admissible":[],"rejected":[],"unresolved":["atlas-b0-d1","atlas-b0-d5","atlas-b1-d0","atlas-b1-d4","atlas-b2-d5","atlas-b2-d3","atlas-b3-d4","atlas-b3-d2","atlas-b4-d3","atlas-b4-d1","atlas-b5-d2","atlas-b5-d0"],"results":[{"candidateId":"atlas-b0