octave normalization; downstream relative birth intervals and relative pitch ratios are preserved.","new_phase_consequence":{"largest_shared_positive_integer_year_modulus":10,"all_admissible_positive_integer_moduli":[1,2,5,10],"proof":"Common phase requires m to divide every reported inter-witness time difference. Their greatest common divisor is10, so the permitted integer moduli are exactly the positive divisors of10. The earlier mod5 relation is valid but does not uniquely select a meter or Cainan membership."},"new_joint_consequence":"Under formal composition of J, twelve insertions restore (year mod10, fifth angular address mod12) but retain +1560 reported years and octave-normalized pitch residual531441/524288. Thus that joint finite phase cannot replace the full chronology/residual/history state.","formal_transport_execution":[{"formal_insertions":0,"delta_generation":0,"delta_reported_years":0,"year_phase_mod10":0,"fifth_angular_phase_mod12":0,"exact_pitch_factor_before_octave_normalization":"1","octave_normalized_pitch_factor":"1"},{"formal_insertions":1,"delta_generation":1,"delta_reported_years":130,"year_phase_mod10":0,"fifth_angular_phase_mod12":7,"exact_pitch_factor_before_octave_normalization":"3/2","octave_normalized_pitch_factor":"3/2"},{"formal_insertions":2,"delta_generation":2,"delta_reported_years":260,"year_phase_mod10":0,"fifth_angular_phase_mod12":2,"exact_pitch_factor_before_octave_normalization":"9/4","octave_normalized_pitch_factor":"9/8"},{"formal_insertions":3,"delta_generation":3,"delta_reported_years":390,"year_phase_mod10":0,"fifth_angular_phase_mod12":9,"exact_pitch_factor_before_octave_normalization":"27/8","octave_normalized_pitch_factor":"27/16"},{"formal_insertions":4,"delta_generation":4,"delta_reported_years":520,"year_phase_mod10":0,"fifth_angular_phase_mod12":4,"exact_pitch_factor_before_octave_normalization":"81/16","octave_normalized_pitch_factor":"81/64"},{"formal_insertions":5,"delta_generation":5,"delta_reported_years":6